This inventory workflow was developed to digitally inventory collections with a 256 GB iPad Mini 6 using the app "SpecimenPro" developed by Mineral Sciences Curator Aaron Celestian. Here is a link to the readme file to see what the app does and how it works: https://github.com/aaroncelestian/StromCollect/blob/main/StromCollect/README.md
### ***SpecimenPro* Workflow...**

